sequenceDiagram
    actor HR
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over HR,DB: Create
    HR->>FE: Fill in title, department, description, submit
    FE->>BE: POST /api/vacancies {title, department, description, ...}
    BE->>DB: Check for an OPEN/ON_HOLD vacancy with same title+department
    alt an active duplicate exists
        BE-->>FE: 409 "An active vacancy with this title and department already exists"
    else no active duplicate
        BE->>DB: Create Vacancy (status defaults to OPEN)
        BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(VACANCY_CREATED)
        BE-->>FE: 201 created vacancy
    end

    Note over HR,DB: Edit / change status (close, reopen, put on hold)
    HR->>FE: Edit fields and/or change status, submit
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/vacancies/:id {..., status?}
    BE->>DB: Fetch current title/department/status
    BE->>BE: Compute effective title/department/status after this update
    alt effective status is OPEN or ON_HOLD AND an active duplicate exists elsewhere
        BE-->>FE: 409 "An active vacancy with this title and department already exists"
    else no conflict
        BE->>DB: Update Vacancy
        alt status changed to CLOSED
            BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(VACANCY_CLOSED)
        else other field(s) changed
            BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(VACANCY_EDITED)
        end
        BE-->>FE: 200 updated vacancy
    end
    Note over BE,DB: Closing a vacancy does NOT block reposting the same title+department later -- only OPEN/ON_HOLD vacancies count as active duplicates
